1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=32911 '''Dugu Yongye''' 獨孤永業] [32911] He was born a Liu(2), but when his father died, his mother, Dugu(1) returned to her family and his surname was changed to Du
2 CONC gu. How this worked is not clear, but our guess is that he became the heir of Ji(2) [32911], who was probably a maternal uncle. In any event, he became the ancestor of all the Tang Dugu(1). Bei Qi Shu, 41.544-45.
