1 CONT Commonor, Li Yu (???): son of Consort Ying 
1 CONT Prince Shu, Li Yin (???): son of Consort Yang I 
1 CONT Prince Jiang, Li Yun (???): son of Wang-shi 
1 CONT Prince Yue, Li Zhen (???): son of Consort Yan 
1 CONT Emperor Gaozong of Tang China: son of Wende Empress 
1 CONT Prince Ji, Li Shen (???): son of Secondary Consort Wei 
1 CONT Prince Jiang, Li Xiao (???): son of Consort Yan 
1 CONT Prince Dai, Li Jian (???): son of one from the harem 
1 CONT Prince Zhao, Li Fu (???): son of Consort Yang II 
1 CONT Prince Cao, Li Ming (???): son of Consort Yang-shi 
